source('equipment2025','土木水工機電設計手冊','Mechanical and Electrical Design for Civil Works Structures EM1110-2-2610','US Army Corps of Engineers','https://www.publications.usace.army.mil/Portals/76/Publications/EngineerManuals/EM%201110-2-2610_FINAL_18Mar2025.pdf','官方二〇二五年三月版本更新閘門機電設備背景；本課力矩壓力僅教學，不給現場啟閉設定。','The March2025 manual updates gate mechanical/electrical context; lesson torque and pressure are educational, not field operating settings.','Official search turn235search47 and catalogue turn235search8 confirm18March2025.',2025)
