source('wilson','威爾遜船閘人字門修復','Wilson Lock miter-gate repairs','USACE Great Lakes and Ohio River Division','https://www.lrd.usace.army.mil/News/News-Releases/Article/4226748/wilson-lock-expected-to-reopen-soon/','官方二〇二五年修復紀錄提及軸承板模板與螺孔對位，僅作安裝驗證背景，不引用預定重開日為已實現。','The2025 repair record describes bearing-plate templates and bolt alignment; used for installation verification, without treating a forecast reopening date as achieved.','Official search turn235search40 describes15May2025 bearing-template work.',2025)
